    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a god-like creature as big as entire solar systems. Your task as a player is to defend your home solar system from invading aliens and to protect it from natural disasters. Use your arsenal of weapons to fight off the enemy but make sure to not cause too much collateral damage! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fully destructible</strong> universe</li><li><strong>28 exciting levels</strong> with increasing difficulty</li><li><strong>High score system</strong> with up to 3 stars per level - can you get a new high score ?</li><li>Cause <strong>chain reactions</strong> to get even higher scores</li><li>Planetary <strong>gravity simulation</strong> (also for fragments of planets and other objects)</li><li>Various weapons like laser guns, rockets, asteroids, ...</li><li>Space combat with allies and enemy fleets</li><li>Natural disasters like meteor strikes</li><li>Realistic <strong>spaceship physics simulation</strong> with thruster-based navigation and autonomous collision avoidance</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a god-like creature as big as entire solar systems. Your task as a player is to defend your home solar system from invading aliens and to protect it from natural disasters. Use your arsenal of weapons to fight off the enemy but make sure to not cause too much collateral damage! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fully destructible</strong> universe</li><li><strong>28 exciting levels</strong> with increasing difficulty</li><li><strong>High score system</strong> with up to 3 stars per level - can you get a new high score ?</li><li>Cause <strong>chain reactions</strong> to get even higher scores</li><li>Planetary <strong>gravity simulation</strong> (also for fragments of planets and other objects)</li><li>Various weapons like laser guns, rockets, asteroids, ...</li><li>Space combat with allies and enemy fleets</li><li>Natural disasters like meteor strikes</li><li>Realistic <strong>spaceship physics simulation</strong> with thruster-based navigation and autonomous collision avoidance</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to a VR game where you rule the universe! Break stuff, enjoy gravity physics, and survive natural disasters. And the best part? Fight off aliens using several guns or even asteroids. Try everything you can to keep your home solar system safe from the dangers out there!",
